# Everything in .forge/ is committed — the registry, the baselines, the vendored
# checkers, and the orientation that CLAUDE.md imports on its first line. A fresh
# clone must be held to the same rules as this one, so nothing here is machine-local
# by default, and this file is the only place an exception may be declared.
#
# A trailing comment on a pattern line becomes part of the pattern, so each
# exception gets its own line above it.

# A stale cache of forge_knowledge; the MCP server is the source of truth
# (see CLAUDE.local.md — there is no local knowledge file by design).
knowledge.json

# Anything a tool writes per machine.
*.local.*
